OL,3,GNEWSADolly Parton's 'incredible' book
OL,4,Ascheme praised
OL,5,
OL,6,FTributes have been paid to Dolly Parton
OL,7,Ffrom branches of her Imagination
OL,8,FLibrary charity across Yorkshire.
OL,10,FThe much-loved singer died, aged 80,
OL,11,Fafter a "brief battle with cancer", her
OL,12,Fmanagement team said on Tuesday.
OL,14,FSet up in 1995, Dolly Parton's
OL,15,FImagination Library has provided free
OL,16,Fbooks to millions of children in the
OL,17,FUnited States, Canada, United Kingdom,
OL,18,FAustralia and Republic of Ireland.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
