OL,3,GNEWSADolly Parton's 'incredible' book
OL,4,Ascheme praised
OL,5,
OL,6,FDeborah Bullivan, who ran the
OL,7,FImagination Library in Rotherham - the
OL,8,Ffirst to be launched in Europe in 2007
OL,9,F- praised the "incredible" country
OL,10,Fmusic icon for her work to inspire
OL,11,Fchildren to read.
